#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain.rst:69
#: a5eccc5520ca4380a5dd1fa374b070da
msgid ""
"This will build the firmware for a quadcopter.  If you wish to build for "
"another frame type (such as hexacopter) append \"-hexa\" onto the end of the"
" make command (i.e. make -j4 pxf-hexa).  The full list of available frames "
"can be found in the `targets.mk "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/mk/targets.mk#L75>`__ "
"file."
msgstr ""
"这将为四旋翼构建固件。如果要为其他机架类型（如六旋翼）构建，请在 make 命令末尾附加「-hexa」（即 make -j4 pxf-"
"hexa）。可用机架的完整列表可在 `targets.mk "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/mk/targets.mk#L75>`__ "
"文件中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain.rst:78
#: 4e6beea0a00847489efe3bf147b37625
msgid ""
"If building for Plane, Rover or Antenna Tracker replace the above "
"\"ArduCopter\" with \"ArduPlane\", \"Rover\" or \"AntennaTracker\"."
msgstr ""
"如果为 Plane、Rover 或 Antenna Tracker "
"构建，请将上面的「ArduCopter」替换为「ArduPlane」、「Rover」或「AntennaTracker」。"

